University of Oxford. Available at: https://www.ashmolean.org/collection-online 
(accessed 2025).

[2] Ashmolean Museum, *Aegean Antiquities Catalogue* (selected online records 
for Minoan gold signet rings, including AN1938.1130), University of Oxford. 
Available at: https://collections.ashmolean.org/resources (accessed 2025).

[3] Jack L. Davis and Sharon R. Stocker, “A golden age of discovery: The Griffin
